      "message": "I think we can have SkBlenderBase::addToKey() be pure virtual. Then we have SkBlendModeBlender implement addToKey() to basically choose between adding a `kBlendMOdeBlender` or the `kCoeffBlender`.  It doesn\u0027t need the `dstColorType` or need to know where the src or dst are coming from.\n\nSkShader_Blend would just call blender-\u003eaddToKey() and theoretically means we could have the SkBlender version of `SkShaders::Blend` factory use SkShader_Blend instead of creating a new runtime shader (I think the main blocker there is the ganesh effects and having RP wire it up correctly, but those are tractable).",
